* ATtiny25/45/85 Pin Definition File for QSymGen3
* Source: Atmel-2586-AVR-8-bit-Microcontroller-ATtiny25-ATtiny45-ATtiny85_Datasheet.pdf
* Package: 8-Pin PDIP/SOIC/TSSOP
*
D ATtiny25/45/85 8-Bit AVR Microcontroller
P ATtiny25 ATtiny45 ATtiny85
*
* R sets ROUT -- the DLL port/pin internal output resistance in ohms.
* Default is 1. Shown explicitly here for tutorial purposes.
R 1
*
* Power pins
V VCC
G GND
*
* SimClock (synthetic -- not a physical device pin)
K SIMCLK
*
* GPIO pins (Port B, bidirectional)
B PB0 MOSI/DI/SDA/AIN0/OC0A/OC1A/AREF/PCINT0
B PB1 MISO/DO/AIN1/OC0B/OC1A/PCINT1
B PB2 SCK/USCK/SCL/ADC1/T0/INT0/PCINT2
B PB3 XTAL1/CLKI/OC1B/ADC3/PCINT3
B PB4 XTAL2/CLKO/OC1B/ADC2/PCINT4
B PB5 RESET/ADC0/dW/PCINT5
